<title>INDIA: Indian crude petroleum output falls in July.</title>
<headline>Indian crude petroleum output falls in July.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's crude petroleum production fell to 2.64 million tonnes in July compared to 3.02 million in the same month last year, the government said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    PETROLEUM OUTPUT     July 96  July 95	 Apr-July</p>
<p>							  1996/97    1995/96</p>
<p>    Crude		     2,640    3,021    10,650     11,833</p>
<p>    Petroleum Products    5,123    5,081    20,380     19,369</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in thousands of tonnes and preliminary. Figures for petroleum products relate to throughput.</p>
</text>
